+/* TASK-007: short phones (Daniel: everything fits): under ~650 px of height the card's breathing tightens (the title a
+   size down, the steps' circles 44, the streets' tabs and the buttons a little slimmer), so "Drive it yourself" is on
+   screen without scrolling (360 x 640: it scrolled 21 px; the iPhone 13's 664 keeps its own sizes); under 600 px (an
